WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.660
Twelve case files.

2
00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:05.750
Open the second: a lady
brings a pearl in a small box,

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:06.390
and a letter.

4
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.380
A locked door.

5
00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:12.820
Even Watson admits, "This is
all an insoluble mystery to me".

6
00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:16.760
Then paw prints, and a
launch on a dark river.

7
00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:17.990
Chapter 10.

8
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.780
Handcuffs click shut.

9
00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:21.340
The thieves are caught.

10
00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:22.710
Case closed.

11
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.990
But two files are still shut.

12
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.390
Why keep reading?

13
00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:29.190
In this mission, you'll
map all twelve chapters,

14
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.400
and ask whose story each
one is really telling.

15
00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:34.820
You'll learn the rules
of the detective game:

16
00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:38.290
a genius, a narrating
friend, baffled police,

17
00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.600
a locked room.

18
00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:43.690
And you'll test every way into
that locked room, with Watson.

19
00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:47.880
Your mission: work out why the
novel needs two more chapters.
